have a book.</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Do</td>\n                    <td>做</td>\n                    <td><strong>What are you doing?</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Go</td>\n                    <td>去</td>\n                    <td><strong>I go to school every day.</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Come</td>\n                    <td>来</td>\n                    <td><strong>Please come here.</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Eat</td>\n                    <td>吃</td>\n                    <td><strong>I eat breakfast at 7 AM.</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Drink</td>\n                    <td>喝</td>\n                    <td><strong>She drinks water.</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Sleep</td>\n                    <td>睡觉</td>\n                    <td><strong>I sleep at 10 PM.</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Read</td>\n                    <td>读</td>\n                    <td><strong>He reads books.</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Write</td>\n                    <td>写</td>\n                    <td><strong>She writes a letter.</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>","id":5},{"name":"XR_H3","data":"4. 常见名词 (Common Nouns)","id":6},{"name":"XR_Temp","data":"<table>\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th>单词</th>\n                    <th>中文翻译</th>\n                    <th>例句</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>Book</td>\n                    <td>书</td>\n                    <td><strong>This is a good book.</strong></td>\n          